 C/PAGES:,NAME,DTRAN  /01.06.84/
C===========================================================
C C/PAGES - report available drum pages and leave M9 on the
C page buffer P/FIRP.  Called with 14,VJM (returns via M14).
C Port of P/PAGES.
C===========================================================
 PASDRUM*:,LC,1
 PASDRN*:,LC,1
 PASPAGN*:,LC,1
 P/FIRP:,PC,1024
 9,VTM,P/FIRP
 14,UJ,
 ,DATA,
 /0001B:,LOG,1
 /0002B:,LOG,20
 /0003B:,LOG,25 0000
 1,SET,/0003B
 1,,PASDRUM*
 1,SET,/0001B
 1,,PASPAGN*
 1,SET,/0002B
 1,,PASDRN*
 ,END,
